WEBVTT

00:04.210 --> 00:06.270
Calling some lame sparks like that

00:06.270 --> 00:08.210
a new power doesn't even work as a bluff.

00:09.770 --> 00:11.740
It's not a bluff.

00:11.740 --> 00:14.390
These sparks are called the Penguin line.

00:14.390 --> 00:16.950
They appear within the Penguin field

00:16.950 --> 00:18.620
when the Penguin device is at full capacity.

00:18.620 --> 00:21.480
Well, it doesn't really matter.

00:21.910 --> 00:25.900
In short, with this power Antarctic Number 8 will be reborn!

00:25.900 --> 00:27.150
This is Evolt!

00:27.550 --> 00:28.440
Evolt?!

00:28.730 --> 00:31.000
Now, feast your eyes on

00:31.000 --> 00:33.700
the strongest robot in the world!

00:33.960 --> 00:34.660
This is...

00:39.200 --> 00:40.700
It hasn't changed at all.

00:40.700 --> 00:43.000
Ahem? Why?!

00:43.040 --> 00:48.380
Turn that voracious sex drive into strength

00:48.010 --> 00:53.930
Daimidaler the Sound Robot

01:01.350 --> 01:07.030
The darkness is spreading

01:06.690 --> 01:12.450
Why do I keep fighting?

01:11.990 --> 01:22.960
I just don't want to lose these days of peace or the sensation I get to feel with these hands

01:22.670 --> 01:28.460
The sound of moaning gives me power

01:27.920 --> 01:31.050
I won't forgive anyone who tries to take them away

01:35.930 --> 01:41.680
Surge with Hi-ERO particles

01:41.390 --> 01:47.110
Attack when fully charged

02:13.300 --> 02:18.100
Episode 10  :

02:13.300 --> 02:18.100
Invoke !Joseph's Symbol

02:13.970 --> 02:15.840
This is a grave matter.

02:16.260 --> 02:18.930
Ritz's machine was unable to "Evolt".

02:18.930 --> 02:19.390
Huh?

02:19.390 --> 02:20.100
A failure?

02:20.100 --> 02:21.560
It failed?!

02:21.810 --> 02:22.730
Wait!

02:22.730 --> 02:24.810
The word "failure" made me realize something.

02:24.810 --> 02:25.650
What?

02:25.650 --> 02:26.770
Really, Dennis?!

02:26.770 --> 02:27.940
What is it?

02:28.570 --> 02:29.440
Breasts!

02:29.730 --> 02:32.150
Doesn't "failure" and "breasts" sound the same?

02:32.150 --> 02:33.650
You're right, they do!

02:33.650 --> 02:35.160
That was a wonderful observation.

02:35.160 --> 02:36.820
Breasts! Breasts!

02:36.820 --> 02:38.620
This is serious you idiots!

02:39.160 --> 02:41.870
At this rate Operation New Penguin will fail

02:42.080 --> 02:45.170
and we might lose Ritz as well.

02:45.620 --> 02:47.880
The body sustained a lot of damage.

02:47.880 --> 02:50.050
The loss of the head was just too much.

02:50.050 --> 02:53.800
As it is, she won't be able to build up enough Penguin line!

02:55.220 --> 02:57.180
What's so funny, Kiriko?!

02:57.180 --> 03:02.430
This is the result of all of your boasting?

03:03.230 --> 03:06.350
Even the strongest enemy, Rikantz Seaberry,

03:06.350 --> 03:10.820
is just a papier-mâché Penguin!

03:10.820 --> 03:13.030
Right, Shouma-kun?

03:13.030 --> 03:15.990
I feel bad for her when you say it like that, Kiriko-chan.

03:15.990 --> 03:18.870
That's like bullying the weak!

03:18.870 --> 03:21.280
Sh-Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

03:21.790 --> 03:22.910
We will not lose!

03:23.330 --> 03:27.040
We love the Penguin Empire. We love Penguins!

03:27.830 --> 03:34.260
That day we were accepted warmly even though we suddenly appeared.

03:34.510 --> 03:37.880
They're our precious family and we want to stay with them forever!

03:38.720 --> 03:44.390
We won't give up on Operation New Penguin. We'll protect our family!

03:44.390 --> 03:47.270
We're going to make a Penguin world for everyone!

03:50.020 --> 03:52.230
This is the end of your terrible Penguin acting.

03:52.230 --> 03:53.440
Ritz!

03:53.440 --> 03:54.990
Your Highness! Ritz!

03:54.990 --> 03:57.740
We have to protect our family!

03:57.740 --> 03:59.110
Your Highness! Your Highness!

03:59.110 --> 04:00.280
I know.

04:00.910 --> 04:02.780
Put the Penguin device on stand-by mode!

04:03.790 --> 04:04.790
Appear, Joseph!

04:04.790 --> 04:05.660
Yes!

04:07.290 --> 04:09.790
The glorious commando, Joseph.

04:09.790 --> 04:12.590
It is time to show everyone the power of your front tail!

04:12.590 --> 04:13.340
Yes!

04:13.340 --> 04:15.130
Do it right, Joseph!

04:15.130 --> 04:16.970
We're putting Ritz in your hands!

04:17.300 --> 04:20.930
Leave it to me! I'll make sure we do it!

04:20.930 --> 04:21.970
Do it.

04:21.970 --> 04:23.100
Making love.

04:23.100 --> 04:24.430
Having sex!

04:24.430 --> 04:30.230
Doing it! Doing it! Doing it!

04:28.560 --> 04:30.230
Hurry up and go!

04:30.690 --> 04:33.360
Penguin device, physical transfer initiated!

04:33.360 --> 04:37.570
Targeted to Antarctic Number 8, Ritz Custom's cockpit!

04:38.360 --> 04:39.360
Transfer!

04:41.740 --> 04:42.740
Wow!

04:42.740 --> 04:43.740
Joseph?!

04:43.740 --> 04:46.240
That's right, Joseph is here.

04:46.240 --> 04:48.080
Thank you, Joseph!

04:49.620 --> 04:50.370
I see.

04:51.040 --> 04:54.540
We're in a huge pinch, but don't worry.

04:54.540 --> 04:57.920
I'll be sure to push this machine into Evolt.

04:57.920 --> 04:59.380
But, how?

04:59.380 --> 05:03.720
It's easy. I'll use my front tail as an antenna.

05:03.720 --> 05:06.220
Your body can do something like that?!

05:06.220 --> 05:09.020
You know the power of my front tail.

05:09.020 --> 05:12.480
I'm called the glorious Penguin commando for a reason.

05:12.480 --> 05:13.730
But...

05:14.400 --> 05:15.480
W-What?!

05:15.730 --> 05:17.150
It's all limp?!

05:17.150 --> 05:18.240
No way!

05:18.240 --> 05:23.200
The gloriously energetic Penguin commando's tail can't be limp!

05:23.200 --> 05:28.500
How terrible. For the Penguin device to affect him in such a way.

05:28.500 --> 05:31.160
So that means, the thing he lost!

05:31.160 --> 05:33.790
His front tail power has been taken!

05:33.790 --> 05:35.210
How can this be?

05:35.210 --> 05:36.420
It's over now!

05:36.420 --> 05:38.210
It's too early to give up.

05:38.210 --> 05:39.340
Joseph?

05:39.760 --> 05:43.970
There are ways for a limp front tail to regain its glory.

05:43.970 --> 05:46.510
All Penguins, no, all men know of this!

05:46.890 --> 05:47.600
Ritz!

05:47.600 --> 05:49.390
What?! Our hands are busy right now.

05:53.140 --> 05:54.440
What are you doing?!

05:54.440 --> 05:57.360
Help me recover my front tail.

05:57.360 --> 05:58.980
By helping you, you can't mean—?!

05:58.980 --> 05:59.480
Yes!

06:00.030 --> 06:02.240
I will do perverted things to Ritz.

06:02.240 --> 06:03.990
N-No...

06:05.780 --> 06:07.080
More!

06:07.080 --> 06:08.330
More!

06:08.660 --> 06:11.580
Shine brighter!

06:12.870 --> 06:15.330
Charge complete.

06:16.920 --> 06:18.590
Thank you, Ritz.

06:18.590 --> 06:22.760
You were a great help to my tail's resurrection.

06:22.760 --> 06:24.470
Now, Penguin line!

06:24.470 --> 06:26.760
Gather! Gather to my front tail!

06:27.220 --> 06:28.560
Another bluff?!

06:28.560 --> 06:29.260
No.

06:29.680 --> 06:31.220
It's different from before...

06:32.680 --> 06:35.690
Penguin change!

06:53.250 --> 06:55.540
Super Antarctic Humboldt Kai!

06:56.830 --> 06:58.080
We did it!

06:59.880 --> 07:00.880
Welcome back.

07:01.710 --> 07:03.460
Good work, Joseph.

07:04.970 --> 07:06.220
Super Antarctic?

07:06.760 --> 07:08.930
It really transformed.

07:08.930 --> 07:11.560
I will find out how powerful it is myself!

07:15.600 --> 07:16.650
