07:21.360 --> 07:23.480
What speed and power!

07:25.190 --> 07:26.280
Checkmate.

07:26.280 --> 07:28.070
We'll steal you away, Kiriko!

07:34.080 --> 07:35.040
Shouma-kun.

07:36.790 --> 07:38.000
Move, boyfriend!

07:38.000 --> 07:40.540
No! I won't give you Kiriko-chan!

07:40.840 --> 07:42.840
I'll protect her no matter what!

07:42.840 --> 07:44.210
Shouma-kun.

07:45.050 --> 07:47.220
Wh-What is this?

07:47.800 --> 07:49.890
I-I feel...

07:50.800 --> 07:53.560
Wh-What, Shouma-kun?

07:55.350 --> 07:58.310
This light, it is a Hi-ERO particle reaction.

07:58.730 --> 07:59.850
What?!

07:59.850 --> 08:02.060
From a human who isn't even a Factor? Why?

08:02.440 --> 08:07.030
Shouma-kun. Answer me if you can hear me! Shouma-kun!

08:07.030 --> 08:09.280
Of course, I can hear you.

08:10.820 --> 08:12.830
I'm Shouma, ya know!

08:12.830 --> 08:14.080
No!

08:14.080 --> 08:18.540
Why?! A normal human emitted Hi-ERO particles!

08:19.040 --> 08:21.040
Why has Ameku Shouma changed into that form?!

08:21.290 --> 08:22.340
Zowie!

08:22.340 --> 08:25.510
Hey, hey, hey, Joseph! That man, could it be?

08:25.510 --> 08:28.880
That skin, form, and stature.

08:28.880 --> 08:31.760
He is definitely a Penguin commando.

08:29.880 --> 08:31.760
No!

08:32.800 --> 08:34.720
Hey, you handsome guy!

08:34.720 --> 08:36.270
You talkin' to me?

08:36.270 --> 08:39.730
Oh, yes. Come over to us.

08:39.730 --> 08:43.150
You'll have lots of friends and it'll be a blast.

08:43.150 --> 08:45.190
Is that okay? Really?

08:45.190 --> 08:48.900
N-No! You can't go to the Penguin Empire!

08:49.150 --> 08:52.200
Kiriko! What right do you have to say something like that?

08:52.200 --> 08:54.160
Shouma-kun is my boyfriend!

08:54.490 --> 08:55.950
What do you mean by boyfriend?

08:55.950 --> 08:57.540
He's completely Penguin!

08:57.540 --> 09:01.420
No! I'll be sure to change Shouma-kun back!

09:01.830 --> 09:02.790
<i>That's right.</i>

09:02.790 --> 09:06.300
<i>No matter what he looks like, Shouma-kun is still inside.</i>

09:09.010 --> 09:10.840
What are you doing?!

09:11.720 --> 09:12.430
Hey!

09:13.050 --> 09:17.930
Leave that boring woman alone and have fun in the Penguin Empire.

09:17.930 --> 09:19.730
All right!

09:19.730 --> 09:22.560
No! That was a lie.

09:22.560 --> 09:24.810
You can do as many perverted things to me as you like!

09:24.810 --> 09:25.730
Really?

09:26.020 --> 09:28.360
Ha! Lies!

09:28.360 --> 09:29.900
I'm not lying!

09:29.900 --> 09:31.740
Then what are you going to do for him?

09:32.660 --> 09:37.450
W-Well, that's, um...

09:37.450 --> 09:40.870
Huh? What? We can't hear you!

09:40.870 --> 09:42.670
I won't tell someone like you!

09:43.040 --> 09:46.500
Shouma-kun, my breasts are larger than hers.

09:46.500 --> 09:47.920
Boobs!

09:48.840 --> 09:50.760
But here's the kicker,

09:50.760 --> 09:52.550
we are still in our growing phase.

09:52.930 --> 09:55.890
They'll get pretty glamorous with time.

09:55.890 --> 09:58.680
By the way, Ritz is currently a D-cup.

09:58.680 --> 09:59.890
D!

10:01.100 --> 10:02.190
Come on!

10:02.190 --> 10:03.770
Yay!

10:03.770 --> 10:05.730
No! Shouma-kun!

10:05.730 --> 10:08.770
No, don't go. Shouma-kun!

10:08.770 --> 10:10.280
Don't go!

10:35.300 --> 10:37.100
What are you doing, Kiriko?

10:37.100 --> 10:39.220
No matter how many Hi-ERO particles you emit,

10:39.470 --> 10:41.980
he won't turn back into a human.

10:42.680 --> 10:44.230
No, he will.

10:45.060 --> 10:47.190
Shouma-kun is a special person.

10:47.730 --> 10:52.190
We're connected by the Hi-ERO particles he's absorbed from me.

10:52.990 --> 10:54.820
I understand this connection.

10:55.240 --> 10:58.990
Now, please come back to your senses.

10:59.530 --> 11:00.990
Accept me.

11:02.660 --> 11:05.160
Come back to me, Shouma-kun!

11:06.250 --> 11:07.750
Kiriko's Hi-ERO particles...

11:08.130 --> 11:10.170
Shouma is absorbing them.

11:10.170 --> 11:11.340
It can't be.

11:13.130 --> 11:16.840
Thank you. I feel like I've been reborn.

11:18.180 --> 11:20.760
Welcome back, Shouma-kun.

11:21.890 --> 11:25.020
I've gotten super-duper energetic!

11:25.020 --> 11:26.270
No!

11:27.810 --> 11:31.520
Why? How did this happen? Why?!

11:31.520 --> 11:33.780
Huh? The reason I got so energetic?

11:33.780 --> 11:35.780
That's cause of the feeling of your boobs right there.

11:35.780 --> 11:37.360
That's not it!

11:38.700 --> 11:42.540
Too bad for you, Kiriko. Just accept it!

11:42.870 --> 11:45.120
He's already become a Penguin!

11:45.120 --> 11:48.540
You're lying! There has to be a way to change him back.

11:48.540 --> 11:50.500
So, Shouma-kun, stay with me.

11:50.500 --> 11:52.960
Nah, s'OK like this! Later.

11:52.960 --> 11:53.420
Shou...

11:53.420 --> 11:54.460
Hey!

11:54.960 --> 11:57.470
Let me be a part of your group, too!

11:57.470 --> 12:00.930
Welcome. We are Rikantz Seaberry.

12:00.930 --> 12:02.470
I'm Joseph.

12:02.470 --> 12:05.770
Also known as the glorious Penguin commando Joseph.

12:05.770 --> 12:07.890
I'm Shouma. Nice ta meetcha!

12:07.890 --> 12:09.020
Nice ta meetcha!

12:09.020 --> 12:10.480
Give him back!

12:14.650 --> 12:16.240
Oops.

12:19.780 --> 12:21.990
Give Shouma-kun back.

12:28.120 --> 12:30.500
What an unreasonable cry-baby!

12:31.670 --> 12:33.630
We can fight you.

12:33.630 --> 12:34.630
But, before that...

12:35.000 --> 12:36.760
Let's change areas!

12:40.760 --> 12:42.550
We have to keep the town safe!

12:43.510 --> 12:45.220
It's all over!

12:45.640 --> 12:46.980
Kiyuna Kiriko.

12:47.480 --> 12:49.980
Joseph. Shouma. You guys should get off.

12:50.270 --> 12:51.730
Try your best, Ritz.

12:51.730 --> 12:54.230
Don't push yourself too much.

12:55.230 --> 12:56.570
Finished already?

12:57.030 --> 13:01.910
We wanted to test out the power of the Super Antarctic. Too bad!

13:02.200 --> 13:04.700
Then, we'll take you...

13:05.240 --> 13:06.290
Shouma-kun.

13:06.620 --> 13:08.120
...to the Penguin Empire!

13:08.750 --> 13:10.330
Shouma-kun!

13:17.630 --> 13:18.300
What is this?!

13:19.010 --> 13:20.720
Hi-ERO particles full burst.

13:21.010 --> 13:22.800
No. Even more than that!

13:23.260 --> 13:25.930
How can she produce this many Hi-ERO particles alone?

13:26.140 --> 13:27.430
It's because she's alone!

13:28.640 --> 13:29.890
Disguise!

13:30.430 --> 13:36.820
Kiyuna Kiriko was able to use her Hi-ERO particles freely for the first time when she met Ameku Shouma.

13:36.820 --> 13:39.740
Now that he has been taken by the Penguin Empire,

13:40.190 --> 13:45.580
she's let her machine go berserk by drowning in her feelings!

13:46.530 --> 13:50.410
Type-6, Kiriko, Disguise. Hi-ERO particles increasing!

13:50.410 --> 13:52.670
Chakra gauges can no longer calculate the numbers!

13:52.920 --> 13:56.170
Whoa?! That's Daimidaler's "Something-Slash"!

13:56.170 --> 13:59.090
If she uses that, it'll cause a lot of trouble for the town!

13:59.510 --> 14:02.550
More importantly, Kiyuna Kiriko's life is in danger.

14:02.550 --> 14:03.760
We have to stop her immediately.

14:03.760 --> 14:05.220
It's no use.

14:05.510 --> 14:08.180
She won't stop no matter what we say.

14:08.180 --> 14:12.390
This is the last shine of Kiyuna Kiriko, who has lost everything.

14:12.390 --> 14:15.610
She plans on destroying them even if it means destroying herself.

14:16.020 --> 14:18.440
That light is her determination.

14:18.440 --> 14:23.200
Fine, Kiyuna Kiriko! Get angry! Shine brighter!

14:23.200 --> 14:26.950
Burn those damn Penguins to the ground with your light!

14:29.450 --> 14:34.710
Shouma-kun, please wait. I'll get revenge for you.

14:35.290 --> 14:37.170
Looks like something big is coming.

14:37.170 --> 14:38.670
We should defeat her while we have the chance.

14:38.670 --> 14:40.340
You can't, Ritz!

14:40.880 --> 14:43.010
You can't attack Daimidaler.

14:43.010 --> 14:45.470
Huh? Why, Shouma?

14:45.470 --> 14:48.390
I know 'cause I was riding Daimidaler!

14:48.390 --> 14:51.970
If you attack sloppily now, it'll get blown to smithereens!

14:52.310 --> 14:53.230
Jesus!

14:53.480 --> 14:56.100
Joseph, Shouma. We should retreat for now.

14:56.100 --> 14:58.520
Kiriko is too dangerous at the moment!

14:58.520 --> 14:59.480
Ritz.

15:00.230 --> 15:06.200
We calculated Daimidaler's attack using the Penguin computer.

15:06.610 --> 15:07.700
According to that...

15:07.700 --> 15:10.160
When? When will she attack?

15:10.160 --> 15:11.410
In ten seconds.

15:11.410 --> 15:12.580
Ten seconds?!

15:12.580 --> 15:14.540
To about five minutes.

15:14.540 --> 15:18.420
That's too wide of a range! That's right, the Penguin device!

15:18.420 --> 15:20.920
You should pick them up using that!

15:20.920 --> 15:25.090
It still hasn't recovered enough energy from sending Joseph there.

15:25.840 --> 15:28.590
This is bad. The Penguin device can't be used,

15:28.590 --> 15:30.930
and we don't have enough time to save them both!

15:30.930 --> 15:33.680
Joseph, Shouma. Run away as fast as you can!

15:33.680 --> 15:38.400
As far as you can! Or go underground through some manhole!

15:38.400 --> 15:39.650
M-Manhole?!

15:39.980 --> 15:41.770
A man's hole, though...

15:41.770 --> 15:43.860
Talking about dirty things so suddenly...

15:43.860 --> 15:45.610
We don't have time to make stupid jokes!

15:45.610 --> 15:48.950
It's fine, Ritz, you should escape alone.

15:50.160 --> 15:51.950
Wh-What are you saying?

15:51.950 --> 15:54.660
There's no way we could leave you two and...

15:54.660 --> 15:55.540
No!

15:56.500 --> 15:59.750
Operation New Penguin has just begun.

15:59.750 --> 16:03.550
The Penguin Empire still needs your strength!

16:03.550 --> 16:06.970
You have to harden your heart like a Penguin and go!

16:06.970 --> 16:07.840
Joseph.

16:07.840 --> 16:12.390
Don't worry, it just means that our luck has run out.

16:12.390 --> 16:13.180
Shouma.

16:13.180 --> 16:17.850
S'OK. There's a lot of porno magazines and snacks here.

16:17.850 --> 16:19.980
Oh, we'll pay for it properly.

16:19.980 --> 16:22.940
We should go all out, comrade.

16:22.940 --> 16:26.610
No, we don't want you two to die!

16:28.780 --> 16:30.700
We won't let you two die!

16:31.070 --> 16:34.160
No matter how strong that Super Antarctic is,

16:34.580 --> 16:38.410
it won't be able to stop a Full Power CP Slash!

16:38.790 --> 16:42.130
Good. Good. This is great!

16:42.130 --> 16:47.220
Who cares about a town or two if we can eliminate Rikantz Seaberry!

16:47.220 --> 16:48.220
A cheap price to pay!

16:48.670 --> 16:50.380
Go! Kiyuna Kiriko!

16:50.380 --> 16:53.680
You are no longer a high school girl or a Factor!

16:53.680 --> 16:57.600
You're just a Hi-ERO bomb full of anger and hatred!

16:57.810 --> 17:01.350
Blow away those Penguins until nothing is left!

17:01.350 --> 17:05.190
Your name will be gloriously engraved in the victorious history

17:05.190 --> 17:10.360
of Beauty Salon Prince for all eternity!

17:17.830 --> 17:19.870
Stop! Stop it!

17:19.870 --> 17:21.420
Joseph! Shouma!

17:21.420 --> 17:22.580
Ritz!

17:23.250 --> 17:24.170
Ritz.

17:24.170 --> 17:25.340
Your Highness?!

17:25.340 --> 17:26.340
Penguin Thrust.

17:27.130 --> 17:29.090
Use the Fiery Blast Penguin Thrust!

17:29.340 --> 17:32.390
Fiery Blast Penguin Thrust.

17:32.390 --> 17:35.510
But that's a hand-to-hand combat attack!

17:35.510 --> 17:40.020
We're not sure we could with a robot we've piloted for the first time...

17:40.020 --> 17:42.020
And, if we fail...

17:42.020 --> 17:43.520
What's wrong, Ritz?

17:43.520 --> 17:46.320
We don't know if we can pull it off.

17:46.650 --> 17:49.190
There's no reason to be afraid, Ritz.

17:49.190 --> 17:53.410
You're a very strong girl. You can do it!

17:53.410 --> 17:55.280
Michael. Dennis.

17:55.490 --> 17:58.240
Turn the tables on her.

17:58.240 --> 17:59.830
Show her what you've got.

17:59.830 --> 18:01.750
Shouma. Joseph.

18:01.750 --> 18:03.040
Do your best, Ritz!

18:03.040 --> 18:05.000
Show them your karate skills!

18:05.000 --> 18:18.180
Morning Ritzness! Morning Ritzness!

18:09.340 --> 18:09.960
Everyone...

18:10.670 --> 18:13.300
Give yourself completely to the Penguin.

18:13.300 --> 18:18.180
Believe in your inner Penguin and release it!

18:18.810 --> 18:22.060
The Penguin always responds to your feelings.

18:22.480 --> 18:23.980
Your Highness.

18:23.980 --> 18:27.360
Open a path to the future using the Fiery Blast Penguin Thrust!

18:27.360 --> 18:27.900
Yes!

18:28.440 --> 18:30.570
We have nothing to be uneasy about.

18:30.570 --> 18:33.150
The Penguin Empire is behind us.

18:33.150 --> 18:37.240
They believe in us so strongly! If that's the case...!

18:37.780 --> 18:43.870
We'll use every last bit of power in Super Antarctic Humboldt Kai!

18:44.620 --> 18:48.840
This last and strongest special attack!

18:51.630 --> 18:52.590
Everyone...

18:54.550 --> 18:55.510
Special Attack!

18:55.510 --> 19:01.020
CP Slash!

19:01.890 --> 19:06.600
Fiery Blast Penguin Thrust!

19:13.570 --> 19:14.650
Whoopie!

19:20.120 --> 19:21.790
Shouma-kun.

19:25.330 --> 19:26.580
I love you.

19:30.540 --> 19:32.130
Type-6 has stopped functioning.

19:32.130 --> 19:34.380
How can this be!

19:34.380 --> 19:35.510
Administrator!

19:36.090 --> 19:38.010
Sonan? Sonan Kyouko?

19:38.550 --> 19:41.510
Send it out. The left arm of Type-2.

19:41.510 --> 19:42.430
No way!

19:42.430 --> 19:45.390
It's not an enemy that can be defeated with a piece of broken metal!

19:45.390 --> 19:46.600
Hurry!

19:47.900 --> 19:50.650
There's a strong Hi-ERO particle response from the left arm of Type-2!

19:51.820 --> 19:53.400
All right. Give it a try!

19:53.900 --> 19:56.320
We don't have time to set up a route for you.

19:56.320 --> 19:58.280
We'll eject you straight from the equipment bay!

20:21.640 --> 20:25.100
Whew. We did it. We pulled it off.

20:25.640 --> 20:29.690
Fiery Blast Penguin Thrust. A truly powerful attack.

20:29.690 --> 20:30.810
Good job, Ritz.

20:31.110 --> 20:33.860
You were able to protect us and the town.

20:33.860 --> 20:35.070
Thanks!

20:35.320 --> 20:37.070
Joseph! Shouma!

20:36.860 --> 20:39.820
Ritz!

20:37.070 --> 20:39.070
You were very cool.

20:39.070 --> 20:39.820
Everyone!

20:40.200 --> 20:42.070
It was superb, Ritz.

20:42.070 --> 20:46.580
It was the power of trust from everyone in the Penguin Empire.

20:46.790 --> 20:51.960
That is Penguin power and the true form of Fiery Blast Penguin Thrust.

20:51.960 --> 20:53.460
Penguin power.

20:54.250 --> 20:55.840
Thank you, Your Highness.

20:56.630 --> 20:58.840
Thank you, everyone.

20:59.300 --> 21:02.760
Thank you, Super Antarctic Humboldt Kai.

21:02.760 --> 21:04.930
I do appreciate you.

21:06.970 --> 21:10.520
The name is too long. Just Kai is enough, we think.

21:11.020 --> 21:11.850
Well, then.

21:12.270 --> 21:14.360
Hey, are you alive, Kiriko?

21:25.120 --> 21:26.330
Wh-What?

21:49.140 --> 21:50.680
H-Him?!

21:50.980 --> 21:52.350
Yeah!

21:52.730 --> 21:56.940
Madanbashi Kouichi is back!

21:57.270 --> 21:57.440
ED START

21:58.480 --> 21:59.610
Leave it to us

21:59.070 --> 22:01.070
Love love li-li-links

22:00.650 --> 22:01.820
Yes!

22:01.950 --> 22:03.700
Prince

22:16.670 --> 22:21.300
Don't worry about the force of the stars

22:21.050 --> 22:25.550
Let's let our power out

22:25.340 --> 22:29.930
It's best to think about who it is that you want to meet

22:29.680 --> 22:33.730
When you want to meet someone

22:33.690 --> 22:36.440
Preparation okay!

22:35.900 --> 22:38.230
Let's go then!

22:38.020 --> 22:40.730
It'll work out somehow

22:40.190 --> 22:42.530
Let's go with that!

22:42.490 --> 22:46.700
When we have something amazing

22:46.660 --> 22:49.450
Our dreams are one, two, infinite

22:49.080 --> 22:51.290
Let's go, everyone

22:50.410 --> 22:51.540
Yes!

22:51.000 --> 22:55.500
Let's make our own happiness

22:55.330 --> 22:59.670
Because if you only wait for happiness to come to you

22:59.380 --> 23:04.260
You'll never be able to have it

23:04.260 --> 23:08.510
For a happy future, you have to be determined

23:08.260 --> 23:09.850
Love love link

23:09.350 --> 23:10.970
I want to be a bride

23:10.470 --> 23:12.140
Leave it to me

23:11.810 --> 23:15.690
Let's have fun around the world

23:27.360 --> 23:42.380
Next Episode

23:28.660 --> 23:31.740
Those mounds are truly the dream of mankind.

23:31.740 --> 23:32.950
The hope for tomorrow.

23:33.540 --> 23:36.370
God, give courage to Eros.

23:37.620 --> 23:41.000
Next episode: "Distraction! The Emperor's Sexual Harassment"

23:37.960 --> 23:42.380
Distraction !
The Emperor's Sexual Harassment

23:41.000 --> 23:42.340
Please look forward to it.

23:41.210 --> 23:42.380
Please watch.
